WEBVTT

00:45:58.960 --> 00:46:02.118
It comes in the middle of a meeting,
comes in the middle of a meal.

00:46:02.142 --> 00:46:04.579
It arrives. It's this
tremendously forceful arrival,

00:46:04.603 --> 00:46:08.098
and it cannot be resisted
without you suffering more.

00:46:08.122 --> 00:46:11.133
So the way that I'm learning
how to dance with grief

00:46:11.157 --> 00:46:13.419
is that when it comes,

00:46:13.443 --> 00:46:16.429
I get about 10 seconds of warning,

00:46:16.453 --> 00:46:19.286
you know, like, "Oh shit, here
it's coming right now."

00:46:19.310 --> 00:46:23.531
And the posture that you take
is you hit your knees

00:46:23.555 --> 00:46:27.327
in absolute humility
and you let it rock you

00:46:27.351 --> 00:46:29.122
until it's done with you,

00:46:29.146 --> 00:46:31.968
and it will be done with you eventually,